cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  The Metadatafication of Version Control: How AI Agents
  Transform Git from Tool to Infrastructure
message: >-
  If you cite this work or use the Canary instrument and snapshot
  data, please use the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: heznpc
    alias: heznpc
repository-code: 'https://github.com/heznpc/canary'
url: 'https://github.com/heznpc/canary'
abstract: >-
  Canary is the design artifact accompanying the paper "The
  Metadatafication of Version Control." The repository hosts
  the manuscript source (paper/main.tex), the experiment code
  (experiments/src/), the canary Next.js dashboard, MCP server,
  and the sanitized snapshot data files that the §5.4 push-leakage
  vignette cites.
keywords:
  - metadatafication
  - version control
  - software engineering 3.0
  - agentic software engineering
  - context engineering
  - operator attention budget
  - git
license: MIT
